{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:694","content":{"id":694,"title":"简化路径","content":[{"children":[{"text":"LeetCode：简化路径。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"52c0e6b8-a809-420d-80f3-d104760b5671","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bb362af9-0c59-4575-b9e0-3a9daa764c84","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"给你一个字符串 path ，表示指向某一文件或目录的 Unix 风格 绝对路径 (以 '/' 开头)，请你将其转化为更加简洁的规范路径。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"34e3c53a-6de3-4f55-bd12-9d071a87eac8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在 Unix 风格的文件系统中，一个点 . 表示当前目录本身；此外，两个点 .. 表示将目录切换到上一级(指向父目录)；两者都可以是复杂相对路径的组成部分。任意多个连续的斜杠(即，'//')都被视为单个斜杠 '/' 。 对于此问题，任何其他格式的点（例如，'...'）均被视为文件/目录名称。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"629142bd-e9ac-469c-b13b-e3a1d26ffdce","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"请注意，返回的 规范路径 必须遵循下述格式：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"24200dc6-2e52-49fd-8b4a-7b3f43bce2ec","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"始终以斜杠 '/' 开头。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"edcb996e-5a22-4538-af2a-ba8dac2e9d2b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8d322440-85dc-4218-84d9-559297cfb0b2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"两个目录名之间必须只有一个斜杠 '/' 。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5fb1eba6-6017-4935-b7db-0b8825f6afbc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"660a1cdb-0864-4ae6-a095-f7a83e81e4d2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"最后一个目录名(如果存在)不能 以 '/' 结尾。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"13845e18-65e5-4d8d-9f64-bf6ed33a0450","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"167c8f74-3d9f-456e-a3e6-779b703ca1f9","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"此外，路径仅包含从根目录到目标文件或目录的路径上的目录(即，不含 '.' 或 '..')。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8f55558e-0c41-4262-a40a-145c89674702","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2953ec81-ae13-47a1-b194-4200c5b232f4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"47f67db0-b232-48c7-b57d-2f464c7ee2f8","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"返回简化后得到的规范路径 。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3ac61217-415d-42bc-b7f3-7beb201b4361","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"示例1：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7a278431-4c83-4a12-bfa4-94dba7ce92b9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：path = \"/home/\"\n输出：\"/home\"","collabId":"e8f0302e-94cd-486a-a38f-eee262fe34a9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0edb262e-3adc-4c61-9fbb-119a17363164","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"34f8904c-2a0d-4d58-82fa-945b6a51eb69"},{"children":[{"text":"示例2：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e2d9e224-1da4-483a-92c5-8f1c8b2f3b72","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：path = \"/../\"\n输出：\"/\"","collabId":"09c187a9-a78c-4d06-a33f-8e85692f3c4e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"117c0192-d4ac-47ea-8709-8e142d8dba2b","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"02ac0c22-fc83-4785-8c09-b6723f8d04be"},{"children":[{"text":"示例3：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6ee3a503-5dc9-47c9-a54d-8d37dcf24863","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：path = \"/a/./b/../../c/\"\n输出：\"/c\"","collabId":"caa17166-26d3-4e34-97be-fd8c49484a62","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d4cd3b48-6398-4e63-b95c-b95040d8117e","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"468231d5-f90e-4603-ae7b-880d1bf118af"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"80277448-83cf-46c5-b8c6-167682e19a2e","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"为了统一处理方便，首先会在路径的后方加入 /，准备一个 List 来保存路径，对路径进行如下判断：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"db19da11-e6d9-4072-8606-e43580c73213","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果路径是以 ../ 开头的，则从 List 的最后删除一个元素(如果 List 不为空)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6436ae23-abec-4d71-bdf0-22117c147b24","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8a2a2de4-f63e-4135-99a7-c561d17712d1","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果路径以 ./ 开头，则什么也不做","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c6938326-6fb7-4c4c-ad72-dca278d5ee5e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4eb61406-7974-41c8-82f5-c54dd84a6cf3","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果路径以 / 开头，则删除后面连续出现的 /","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4e7e7f83-8953-4036-827c-5d303538ac9b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"505c096f-daf0-4b19-9084-6532d40caf95","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果路径以空格开头，则删除后面连续出现的空格","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"69dbc70a-3457-430b-a596-77f69518a9cf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f8ea1331-9899-46c8-a9a3-dc6dedae7d2a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"最后不是上述情况，则将 / 之前的字符添加进 List 中","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b00658e9-6f70-4956-bddf-d960c0a9ba53","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"e8233ed7-6e01-400d-aab8-c0c099ca4787","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"aea49dca-e182-4f74-b1df-6c3a323edffc","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"public String simplifyPath(String path) {\n    // 这一步经典，处理起来方便，佩服我自己\n    path = path + \"/\";\n    List<String> paths = new ArrayList<>();\n    while (!path.equals(\"\")) {\n        if (path.startsWith(\"../\")) {\n            // 这是从 Vue 源码学到的，解析完的部分就干掉\n            path = path.substring(3);\n            if (!paths.isEmpty()) {\n                paths.remove(paths.size() - 1);\n            }\n        } else if (path.startsWith(\"./\")) {\n            path = path.substring(2);\n        } else if (path.startsWith(\"/\")) {\n            int count = 1;\n            for (int i = 1; i < path.length(); i++) {\n                if (path.charAt(i) == '/') {\n                    count++;\n                } else {\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            path = path.substring(count);\n        } else if (path.startsWith(\" \")) {\n            int count = 1;\n            for (int i = 1; i < path.length(); i++) {\n                if (path.charAt(i) == ' ') {\n                    count++;\n                }else {\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            path = path.substring(count);\n        } else {\n            int index = path.indexOf(\"/\");\n            paths.add(path.substring(0, index));\n            path = path.substring(index + 1);\n        }\n    }\n\n    StringBuilder stringBuilder = new StringBuilder();\n\n    if (paths.size() == 0) {\n        stringBuilder.append(\"/\");\n        return stringBuilder.toString();\n    }\n\n    for (String s : paths) {\n        stringBuilder.append(\"/\").append(s);\n    }\n    return stringBuilder.toString();\n}","collabId":"8a6b355d-4928-404a-a2a8-8a3d1f53cbdd","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"dda5758c-c432-4135-8bfe-45d7c707995e","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c61a4bc8-eb83-436f-9189-24899d69c5a0"},{"children":[{"text":"参考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"09b2be67-7c9a-4bd0-833d-2de2e668045a","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"简化路径","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"443c650f-b6c2-4d0c-a53a-da3ddd968083","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/simplify-path/"}],"collabId":"8ffc02fc-6f5f-4ff7-b654-f67e4e230e37","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4fd53696-3d04-4c4c-8f90-cb330bd3ddb2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"5c90353e-236a-451a-9b56-15541f1c3fdd","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"字符串"},{"label":"简化路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:694","type":"doc","id":694}}],"prevPage":{"title":"二叉树的最近公共祖先","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:725","type":"doc","id":725}},"nextPage":{"title":"最长回文字符串","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:713","type":"doc","id":713}},"createTime":1729000003033,"updateTime":1793532543973,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532543973}}